    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NETHERLANDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Netherlands is mentioned multiple times in relation to squadrons formed from non-Commonwealth personnel during the Second World War."</data>
