    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECOND WORLD WAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Second World War is the historical context in which many of these squadrons were formed."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0333-27de14294b12</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NON-COMMONWEALTH PERSONNEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Non-Commonwealth personnel refers to individuals or units from countries outside the Commonwealth, contributing to military forces during the Second World War."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0333-27de14294b12</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;STRIKE FIGHTER SQUADRON 94 (VFA-94)&quot;" target="&quot;UNITED STATES NAVY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"VFA-94 is part of the United States Navy, operating under its command and following its directives."</data>
      <data key="d5">"military affiliation, operational command"</data>
